From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c4pp4
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Update status on icon theme change

The indicator is shown only when both GTK and icon themes are Yaru,
so update its status also when the icon theme changes.

Signed-off-by: c4pp4
---
 unity-indicator-appearance | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/unity-indicator-appearance b/unity-indicator-appearance
--- a/unity-indicator-appearance
+++ b/unity-indicator-appearance
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@
     indicator.set_menu(build_menu())
     update_menu_status(appearance_settings, None)
     appearance_settings.connect('changed::gtk-theme', update_menu_status)
+    appearance_settings.connect('changed::icon-theme', update_menu_status)
     notify.init(APPINDICATOR_ID)
     gtk.main()
 
-- 
